<div class="faq-page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">What payment methods do you accept? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, PayPal, Apple Pay, and Google Pay.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Is your website secure? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">Absolutely. All transactions are encrypted with industry-standard SSL security. Your payment information is never stored on our servers.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Where do you ship? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We currently ship to all 50 US states. We're working on expanding to Canada and select international destinations — stay tuned!</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">How much is shipping? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">Shipping is calculated at checkout based on your location and order size. Orders over $50 ship free!</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">How long does shipping take? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">Most orders are processed within 1-3 business days. Standard delivery takes 7-14 business days across the US. Express shipping options are available at checkout (5-8 business days).</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Do you offer tracking? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">Yes! You'll receive a tracking number via email as soon as your order ships.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Is shipping eco-friendly? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We use plastic-free packaging materials wherever possible and partner with carbon-offset shipping carriers to reduce our environmental impact.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">What is your return policy? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We offer a 30-day return policy on most items. Products must be unused and in original packaging. Contact us with your order number to start a return.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">How do I start a return? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">Contact us at hello@ecogrowco.com with your order number and reason for return. We'll provide instructions within 24 hours.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Who pays for return shipping? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We cover return shipping on defective or incorrect items. For other returns, the customer is responsible for return shipping costs.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">How long do refunds take? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days after we receive your return. The amount will appear on your original payment method within 3-5 additional business days.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Are your products truly eco-friendly? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We carefully vet every product for genuine sustainability. This includes material sourcing, manufacturing processes, packaging, and product lifespan. We're transparent about what makes each product eco-friendly — no greenwashing here.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Do you sell plants or seeds? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We focus on gardening tools, accessories, and decor — not live plants or seeds (due to USDA import restrictions). Think: the tools that help you garden better, not the plants themselves.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">How can I contact support? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">Visit our Contact page, email us at hello@ecogrowco.com, or reach out on Instagram @EcoGrowCo. We aim to respond within 24 hours on business days.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-item__question">Can I change or cancel my order? <span>+</span></div>
    <div class="faq-item__answer">We process orders quickly to get them on their way. If you need to modify or cancel, please contact us within 2 hours of placing your order and we'll do our best to help.</div>
  </div>
</div>

